From: ae-automation-bot <ae-automation-bot@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:02:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 254/260] [ae-patch] Mark a Claude Code subagent disconnected
 when only re-sent items follow its last real activity

A runner restart re-sends a dead subagent's old items and reports it running, which restarted the full 60-minute settle. Quiet is now measured from the newest stored item, the settle arms for the time left, a settled child is labelled runner_disconnected so the rail shows Disconnected, a waiting child is timed out too, and the cap reads OMNIGENT_AE_CLAUDE_SUBAGENT_STALE_AFTER_S.
